 "player_note": "The post (8 March 2000) says: \"This is the deck I used at the Florida Grand Slam. It went 3-0, defeating Court Musicians, Court Bounty Hunters, and Endor Operations. It is very similar to the deck Charlie Herren used to win the event undefeated and is based off of Simon Moores deck which he used to win the UK Grand Slam.\" (The 2000 Florida Grand Slam was held at Merritt Island, March 2000.)"
